OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity of Aberdeen staff
OL,4,Aballoted on strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of UCU are now being asked if
OL,7,Fthey are willing to take future strike
OL,8,Faction. The university said it wanted a
OL,9,F"positive and constructive
OL,10,Frelationship" with trade unions.
